{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471870",
      "title": "Framer Motion Basics & Fundamentals",
      "sourceHash": "2c2dfd818838ce4dc4d72c2c6055abd31cfa7cd57651b6b186d8a04d080a21d2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.45,
          "end": 1.68,
          "en": "So here in this playground,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.68,
          "end": 3.24,
          "en": "we got this box here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 3.24,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "and we got a couple of input fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 10.04,
          "en": "And my idea now is to allow you to enter values here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.29,
          "end": 11.79,
          "en": "into these input fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.79,
          "end": 15.663,
          "en": "and to then animate this box based on those input fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.59,
          "end": 20.01,
          "en": "For example, if you enter five here into the input X",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.01,
          "end": 24.03,
          "en": "this block here should be moved to the right by five pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.03,
          "end": 25.083,
          "en": "That's the idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.07,
          "end": 29.34,
          "en": "And of course, this should be achieved with Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.34,
          "end": 34.34,
          "en": "so that this change in position or rotation is animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 37.41,
          "en": "Now for that, we can go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.41,
          "end": 41.25,
          "en": "into the app.jsx file in this playground project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.25,
          "end": 42.48,
          "en": "And as you see there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.48,
          "end": 45.93,
          "en": "we already have some state management going on here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.93,
          "end": 50.01,
          "en": "to get the values entered by the user essentially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.01,
          "end": 52.023,
          "en": "And here we got this box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.89,
          "end": 55.5,
          "en": "Now to animate it with Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.5,
          "end": 59.07,
          "en": "all you have to do is import motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.07,
          "end": 64.07,
          "en": "from Framer Motion and you have to replace this div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.5,
          "end": 69.5,
          "en": "or whichever element you wanna animate with motion.div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 74.13,
          "en": "This will then still render a div on the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.13,
          "end": 78.99,
          "en": "but a div with extra capabilities that can be controlled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.99,
          "end": 83.2,
          "en": "by Framer Motion to animate it in a highly performant way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.15,
          "end": 88.26,
          "en": "because that's important about this Framer Motion package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.26,
          "end": 92.78999999999999,
          "en": "It's really built to give you high performance animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 92.78999999999999,
          "end": 96.47999999999999,
          "en": "not animations that cause unnecessary component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.47999999999999,
          "end": 100.38,
          "en": "re-render cycles or that slow down the application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.38,
          "end": 104.523,
          "en": "but instead animations that are as performant as possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 105.99000000000001,
          "end": 109.41,
          "en": "That's why you have to use special elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 109.41,
          "end": 112.71000000000001,
          "en": "And there is not just motion div, of course, instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 112.71000000000001,
          "end": 116.49000000000001,
          "en": "if you press the dot after motion, you see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 116.49000000000001,
          "end": 119.88,
          "en": "that you basically got all HTML elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 124.88,
          "en": "as motion versions so that you can really animate anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 125.01,
          "end": 126.813,
          "en": "But here is a div I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 128.07,
          "end": 131.97,
          "en": "Now with this special motion component here being used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 131.97,
          "end": 134.16,
          "en": "we can now add a special prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 134.16,
          "end": 136.98,
          "en": "to this component, the animate prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 136.98,
          "end": 140.28,
          "en": "which is available because we're using this motion version",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 140.28,
          "end": 141.123,
          "en": "of the div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 142.05,
          "end": 146.67000000000002,
          "en": "And Animate now in its basic form wants an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 146.67000000000002,
          "end": 151.59,
          "en": "as a value where we describe the animation we wanna play.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 151.59,
          "end": 154.56,
          "en": "And here you can animate a broad variety",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 154.56,
          "end": 158.43,
          "en": "of things because Framer Motion is really powerful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 158.43,
          "end": 161.25,
          "en": "You can, for example, animate the text color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 161.25,
          "end": 164.313,
          "en": "or the background color of an element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 165.21,
          "end": 169.32,
          "en": "You can animate the rotation, you can animate the X",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 169.32,
          "end": 173.64,
          "en": "and Y position and a lot of other things as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 173.64,
          "end": 175.8,
          "en": "Simply play around with this prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 175.8,
          "end": 177.24,
          "en": "and all the things you can set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 177.24,
          "end": 180.54,
          "en": "and take a look at the official documentation to learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 180.54,
          "end": 183.063,
          "en": "about all the things you can animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 184.29,
          "end": 187.14,
          "en": "Now, one of the most common things to animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 187.14,
          "end": 189.87,
          "en": "is the position of an element though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 189.87,
          "end": 192.06,
          "en": "because often the elements should move around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 192.06,
          "end": 195.06,
          "en": "on the website and we can, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 195.06,
          "end": 199.07999999999998,
          "en": "animate the movement along the horizontal axis",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.07999999999998,
          "end": 202.98,
          "en": "by animating the X coordinate of the element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 202.98,
          "end": 207.9,
          "en": "And we can set this here for example, to this X.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 207.9,
          "end": 212.9,
          "en": "So this X is now what I'm feeding as a value to this X here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 215.22,
          "end": 218.57999999999998,
          "en": "and therefore whenever this state here updates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 218.57999999999998,
          "end": 220.32,
          "en": "the animation should play again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 220.32,
          "end": 223.02,
          "en": "because that's how Framer Motion works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 223.02,
          "end": 225.24,
          "en": "When you set this animate prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 225.24,
          "end": 227.79,
          "en": "it will re-trigger the animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 227.79,
          "end": 231.09,
          "en": "and animate this element whenever the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 231.09,
          "end": 233.34300000000002,
          "en": "you want to animate to changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 234.6,
          "end": 238.44,
          "en": "So therefore, here, if we save this, if I type 100 here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 238.44,
          "end": 241.29,
          "en": "you see that moved to the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 241.29,
          "end": 244.68,
          "en": "If I type minus 300, you see it moves to the left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 244.68,
          "end": 246.54,
          "en": "And as you can also see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 246.54,
          "end": 250.2,
          "en": "it's also animated whilst it moves around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 250.2,
          "end": 253.17,
          "en": "and it indeed has animation that looks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 253.17,
          "end": 256.29,
          "en": "and feels really realistic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 256.29,
          "end": 259.92,
          "en": "If you can say that, it has a realistic look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 259.92,
          "end": 262.2,
          "en": "and feel because it bounces a little bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 262.2,
          "end": 266.94,
          "en": "it feels like if you would really be pushing a block around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 266.94,
          "end": 271.17,
          "en": "and that's another feature built into Framer Motion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 271.17,
          "end": 274.65,
          "en": "It gives you this natural look and feel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 274.65,
          "end": 278.34000000000003,
          "en": "for your animations, at least if you want it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 278.34000000000003,
          "end": 282.12,
          "en": "Now, when using Framer Motion, the animate prop is one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 282.12,
          "end": 285.24,
          "en": "of your most important props because it's this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 285.24,
          "end": 290.24,
          "en": "prop that's used to declaratively animate an element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 290.88,
          "end": 295.38,
          "en": "but another important prop is the transition prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 295.38,
          "end": 298.56,
          "en": "which is a prop that can be used to configure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 298.56,
          "end": 300.453,
          "en": "the animation that will be played.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 301.5,
          "end": 305.01,
          "en": "You do that by passing an object to transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 305.01,
          "end": 305.843,
          "en": "and then here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 305.843,
          "end": 309.273,
          "en": "in this object you can set a broad variety of things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 310.32,
          "end": 311.883,
          "en": "For example, the duration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 311.883,
          "end": 316.56,
          "en": "over which this change in this value will be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 316.56,
          "end": 319.23,
          "en": "For example, we could set this to three",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 319.23,
          "end": 321.483,
          "en": "which would mean three seconds,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 323.16,
          "end": 326.82,
          "en": "with that, if I saved this and I changed this X value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 326.82,
          "end": 330.06,
          "en": "you now see that the animation plays much slower",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 330.06,
          "end": 332.94,
          "en": "because I decreased that duration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 332.94,
          "end": 336.753,
          "en": "It now takes three seconds to go to the end state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 338.52,
          "end": 340.38,
          "en": "but the duration isn't everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 340.38,
          "end": 341.58,
          "en": "though I'll set it back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 341.58,
          "end": 345.96,
          "en": "to a much lower value so that the animation plays quicker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 345.96,
          "end": 348.63,
          "en": "Another thing you can set here, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 348.63,
          "end": 350.553,
          "en": "is the type property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 351.6,
          "end": 354.654,
          "en": "The type property allows you to control which type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 354.654,
          "end": 357.3,
          "en": "of animation should be played.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 357.3,
          "end": 361.38,
          "en": "For example, this spring type, which was the default as long",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 361.38,
          "end": 363.99,
          "en": "as this transition prop wasn't added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 363.99,
          "end": 367.2,
          "en": "is this type that has this natural look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 367.2,
          "end": 371.07,
          "en": "and feel with this bouncing and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 371.07,
          "end": 374.1,
          "en": "And you can indeed also control how much it bounces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 374.1,
          "end": 377.04,
          "en": "by adding the bounce property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 377.04,
          "end": 378.6,
          "en": "If you set bounce to one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 378.6,
          "end": 381.43,
          "en": "you got a lot of bouncing going on as you can see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 382.38,
          "end": 387.153,
          "en": "and if you set it to zero, you got no bouncing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 388.17,
          "end": 390.09,
          "en": "And of course you can set it to any value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 390.09,
          "end": 393.46,
          "en": "between zero and one to control how much it bounces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 394.59000000000003,
          "end": 397.47,
          "en": "but you can also switch to a different type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 397.47,
          "end": 399.78,
          "en": "For example, if you change to tween",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 399.78,
          "end": 402.42,
          "en": "you'll have a simple animation between the starting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 402.42,
          "end": 406.68,
          "en": "and end value without any physics simulation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 406.68,
          "end": 408.993,
          "en": "as you do get it when using spring.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 409.98,
          "end": 412.08,
          "en": "So if I change to tween here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 412.08,
          "end": 415.05,
          "en": "you'll see that now there is no bouncing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 415.05,
          "end": 417.18,
          "en": "no matter which bounce factor you set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 417.18,
          "end": 418.92,
          "en": "Instead, you have a simple animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 418.92,
          "end": 421.143,
          "en": "between the start and the end value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 422.94,
          "end": 425.07,
          "en": "Now, sometimes this might be the look you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 425.07,
          "end": 427.86,
          "en": "but often it's this spring type you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 427.86,
          "end": 431.58,
          "en": "because especially when animating the position or size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 431.58,
          "end": 436.58,
          "en": "of elements using this physics-based approach often looks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 436.86,
          "end": 439.293,
          "en": "and feels best for users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 440.25,
          "end": 443.22,
          "en": "So that's why I'll stick to spring here and why",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 443.22,
          "end": 447.15,
          "en": "I will now also make sure that we can also animate movement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 447.15,
          "end": 451.14,
          "en": "on the Y axis by picking up that Y state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 451.14,
          "end": 456.14,
          "en": "and binding that to our animate prop and also rotations.",
          "zh": ""
